  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Shown in the figure is a hollow ice-cream cone (it is open at top). If its mass is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>, radius of its top is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;and height,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>, then its moment of inertia about its axis is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/eb02c1ca-ac0e-48eb-9505-899ed438a4f7-image.png\" style=\"width: 152px; height: 260px;\" /></p>",
