  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It can be assumed as several parts of discs having different radius, so</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/393649f4-7d5d-4b12-9c2c-d0545a5208b5-image.png\" style=\"width: 155px; height: 183px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>dl</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>dm</mi><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>From diagram</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mtext>&#952;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>dm</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#961;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mtext>&#960;</mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>dy</mi></math></p><p>From equation (i), (ii) and (iii)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
